msgid "A manga reader that connects to your personal Kavita server."
msgstr "连接个人 Kavita 服务器的漫画阅读器。"

msgid "API key"
msgstr "API 密钥"

msgid "Add Kavita server"
msgstr "添加 Kavita 服务器"

msgid "Adjust"
msgstr "调整"

msgid "Adjust image contrast (gamma). Higher values increase contrast for darker blacks. 1.0 is no adjustment."
msgstr "调整图像对比度（伽马值）。数值越高，黑色越深、对比越强；1.0 表示不做调整。"

msgid "Auto rotation adjusts screen orientation automatically. Locked keeps the current system rotation fixed."
msgstr "“自动”会根据设备方向自动调整屏幕方向；“锁定”则保持当前系统旋转方向不变。"

msgid "Automatically trim uniform white or black margins around page content (Mihon-style). Each page is analyzed after download; pages without uniform borders are left unchanged. Detection adds a one-time decode per page."
msgstr "自动裁掉页面内容周围纯白或纯黑的边距（类似 Mihon）。每页下载后都会进行分析；没有统一边框的页面保持原样。检测会给每页增加一次解码开销。"

msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "背景颜色"

msgid "Boost color saturation to make colors pop on dim e-ink screens. 1.0 = neutral, higher = more vivid, lower = desaturated (0 = grayscale). Uses a smart curve that protects already-vivid colors from clipping and leaves grays untouched. Only affects color rendering."
msgstr "提升色彩饱和度，让颜色在较暗的电子墨水屏上更鲜艳。1.0 为中性，数值越高越鲜艳，越低越淡（0 为灰度）。采用智能曲线，避免原本鲜艳的颜色溢出，同时不改变灰色。仅影响彩色渲染。"

msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

msgid "Cannot load content. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法加载内容，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Cannot load dashboard. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法加载首页，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Cannot load data from server. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法从服务器加载数据，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Cannot load image on page %1"
msgstr "无法加载第 %1 页的图像"

msgid "Cannot load next chapter: missing series info"
msgstr "无法加载下一章：缺少系列信息"

msgid "Cannot load reading list. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法加载阅读列表，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Cannot load reading lists. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法加载阅读列表，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Cannot load series details. Please check your connection."
msgstr "无法加载系列详情，请检查网络连接。"

msgid "Chapter End"
msgstr "章节结束"

msgid "Choose the background color for the image viewer."
msgstr "选择图像查看器的背景颜色。"

msgid "Choose what happens when you reach the end of a chapter: 'Stop' stays on the last page, 'Ask' shows a dialog to continue or close, 'Auto' automatically continues to the next chapter."
msgstr "选择读到章节末尾时的行为：“停止”停留在最后一页；“询问”弹出对话框让你选择继续或关闭；“自动”自动进入下一章。"

msgid "Choose what information to display in the footer."
msgstr "选择页脚显示的信息。"

msgid "Clock"
msgstr "时钟"

msgid "Color Boost"
msgstr "色彩增强"

msgid "Colors:"
msgstr "上色："

msgid "Completed"
msgstr "已完结"

msgid "Connecting to %1…"
msgstr "正在连接 %1…"

msgid "Continue Reading"
msgstr "继续阅读"

msgid "Continue to next chapter?"
msgstr "是否继续阅读下一章？"

msgid "Continuous"
msgstr "连续模式"

msgid "Controls internal rendering resolution. Low/High cap rendering based on screen size to save memory on large images. Native always uses full image resolution. Images smaller than threshold are never upscaled."
msgstr "控制内部渲染分辨率。“低”/“高”会根据屏幕尺寸限制渲染大小，以便在大图上节省内存；“原生”始终使用完整图像分辨率。小于阈值的图像不会被放大。"

msgid "Cover Art:"
msgstr "封面："

msgid "Crop Borders"
msgstr "裁切边框"

msgid "Delete Kavita server?"
msgstr "删除 Kavita 服务器？"

