msgstr "双页间距"

msgid "Edit Kavita server"
msgstr "编辑 Kavita 服务器"

msgid "Editors:"
msgstr "编辑："

msgid "Empty search"
msgstr "搜索内容为空"

msgid "Enable or disable automatic page prefetching. When enabled, upcoming pages are loaded in the background for smooth navigation."
msgstr "启用或禁用自动页面预取。启用后，后续页面会在后台加载，翻页更流畅。"

