msgstr "在连续模式下，设置使用上/下按钮时的滚动距离。"

msgid "In continuous view mode, sets the gap inside the viewport between stacked pages."
msgstr "在连续模式下，设置视口内上下页面之间的间距。"

msgid "In dual page mode, sets the gap between the two side-by-side pages."
msgstr "在双页模式下，设置并排两页之间的间距。"

