msgid "Reading order of the two halves of a split wide page. Auto follows Page Direction; LTR shows the left half first; RTL shows the right half first. Use LTR or RTL when a book is bound opposite to your page-turn direction."
msgstr "分割宽页后两半的阅读顺序。“自动”跟随翻页方向；“左至右”先显示左半页；“右至左”先显示右半页。如果书籍装订方向与翻页方向相反，请选择“左至右”或“右至左”。"

