msgid "Set how the page should be resized to fit the screen. In continuous mode, only 'width' is available for consistent page alignment."
msgstr "设置页面如何缩放以适应屏幕。在连续模式下只能使用“宽度”，以保证页面对齐一致。"

msgid "Set the reading direction and page-turn direction. Also selects which half is read first when Split Direction is Auto."
msgstr "设置阅读方向和翻页方向。当分割方向为“自动”时，也会决定先读哪一半。"

msgid "Sets the margin at the bottom of the viewport."
